---
permalink: /authors/editorial-team/
title: "Editorial Team — Green Plus EXIM"
description: "The Green Plus EXIM editorial team researches and fact-checks the trade data and market guides published on this site."
lang: en
dir: ltr
breadcrumbs: [{ label: "Authors", url: "/authors/" }, { label: "Editorial Team" }]
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}
{% block schema %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{{ {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Person",
  "name": "Green Plus EXIM Editorial Team",
  "url": (site.url + "/authors/editorial-team/"),
  "worksFor": { "@type": "Organization", "name": site.companyName, "url": site.url },
  "description": authors[1].bio
} | jsonify | safe }}
</script>
{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
{% set pageH1 = "Editorial Team" %}
{% set pageLede = "Research & Content" %}
{% include "partials/page-header.njk" %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="container prose" style="max-width:70ch">
    <p>{{ authors[1].bio }}</p>
    <p>See our <a href="/resources/glossary/">glossary</a> and product/market pages for the public sources we cite throughout the site.</p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
